This program is a Python login system.
The variable "logearse" is used to repeat the program.

The program asks the user for a username and an email.
The variable "correo" is the email entered by the user.

The program checks the email.
It verifies if the email has "@" and ".".
It also checks if the email starts with invalid characters.

Now the program is validating the email.

Then the program asks the user for a password.
The variable "contraseña_de_usuario" is the password of the user.

The program checks if the password has at least eight characters.
It checks if the password contains numbers and uppercase letters.

Now the system is analyzing the password.

Finally, the program prints messages.
If the password is correct, the user can enter the system.
